SEMForge Notice

SEMForge is private commercial software.

The product embeds third-party production dependencies, including Noto
Sans KR font files used by the web application and PDF renderer. Their
copyright and license notices are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
Production container images regenerate THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md after
installing platform-specific optional packages so bundled sharp/libvips
runtime notices are included with the distributed image.
Operators must keep release evidence for the accessible sharp-libvips
source bundle and the verified relink/install procedure before
distributing a production container image.

Container runtime images also include Debian operating-system packages
installed by the Dockerfile, including Chromium and fonts-noto-cjk.
Those package notices remain available inside the image under
/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.
